WEBVTT

00:06:29.436 --> 00:06:32.276
saying that coding Java is the new Latin.

00:06:35.236 --> 00:06:37.356
The second thing I learned
from the families

00:06:37.356 --> 00:06:40.356
who are calm and confident
about their children’s digital lives

00:06:40.356 --> 00:06:43.276
is that they share 
the decision-making within the family.

00:06:43.676 --> 00:06:44.756
They negotiate;

00:06:44.756 --> 00:06:45.956
they don’t impose.

00:06:46.436 --> 00:06:49.196
They listen to their children's views

00:06:49.196 --> 00:06:51.636
and they even share
some digital pleasures together.

00:06:52.476 --> 00:06:56.156
So Dani loves it when Josh
invites his friends around

00:06:56.156 --> 00:06:58.036
and they all play “Minecraft” together,

00:06:58.036 --> 00:07:00.316
and she sets them coding challenges